* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_iled (reference/crafted.toml, 18 Nov 2026): two defects found on a local
* model and fixed in M1.3 change 64, reproduced on open data:
* - an EPS lead time (NCAP_ILED 0 under $ONEPS) on the new gas plant ELCTNGAS01 in REG1: its interest
*   during construction is half a year's (eqobjinv.mod L219-229: IF(Z, ...) is true for EPS);
* - early retirement allowed (PRC_RCAP) for the gas plant in REG1, and for TJL_NOPRC, a process of no
*   region, in REG2: prepret.dsc L49, PRC_RCAP(PRC_RCAP(RP)) = PRC_CAP(RP), leaves a record outside RP.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
SET PRC
/
TJL_NOPRC 'Crafted: a process of no region (TIMES.jl demo12_iled)'
/

SET PRC_RCAP
/
REG1.ELCTNGAS01
REG2.TJL_NOPRC
/

PARAMETER NCAP_ILED /
REG1.2006.ELCTNGAS01 0
/;
